<title>USA: Catherines Oct same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Catherines Oct same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$22.6	$23.1     - 2.3	- 5.1</p>
<p>Third Qtr	  $65.6	$69.5     - 5.6	- 9.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $204.9     $206.3     - 0.7	- 5.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended  Nov. 1, 1996.</p>
<p>    Full company name is		  Catherines Stores Corp</p>
